WEBVTT

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:07.500
You told your mother that you'd
"become a respectable person."

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:09.790
Yes.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:15.750
However, if the world itself is no longer,
you can't fulfill your promise to your mother.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.870
So it's a deal, then?

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.040
You can become the hero that will save the world.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:26.870
That's impossible for someone like me.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:28.750
This isn't about "someone like you."

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:33.120
This is possible because OF you.

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.000
Hey, look at that!

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:08.290
It's the three Saotome Sisters!

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:10.750
They're always so cute.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:19.040
And he's always so scary-looking.

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:20.790
Shh! He can hear you!

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:24.830
Akuma looks scarier than ever today!

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:30.700
The semester exam results are announced today!

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:34.910
Student Council Room

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:34.910
Inukai-san, can you copy the documents for me?

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:36.410
Will do.

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:39.660
You've been really gung-ho lately, President.

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:43.250
Yes. We don't have much time
before the school festival.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.620
As a student council president
that just transferred here,

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:49.660
I'm worried about being accepted by everyone.

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:51.080
It will be okay!

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.370
Matsumura-san?

00:02:52.750 --> 00:03:01.580
NO Chains at Hokuou Academy!!

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.250
Chains are something that bind the heart!

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:57.500
An innovative school reformation!

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.080
An improvement in student autonomy!

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:02.040
That inauguration speech will soon be legendary!

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:05.040
Oh no. The reason someone
so unfamiliar with the school like me

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:09.620
got so very far and became president
is solely because I had the support of all of you.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.290
Matsumura-san. Inukai-san. Nishida-san.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:17.660
I am so very proud that I can rely on so much.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:22.580
Ba-dump

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.830
Superior! You are superior, President!

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:23.080
I will follow you all the days of my life!

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:27.200
Aaah

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:27.200
By the way, President, you did amazingly well
on this semester's exams.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:27.200
President!

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:30.000
Second Semester Midterms Exam Results (11 Subjects 1100 Points)
Itsuyo Saotome
Yusuke Matsumura

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:29.660
Number 1?!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.120
Itsuyo got number 1?!

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:32.870
She got a perfect score in all subjects.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:36.580
That's so impressive. My math score was bad.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.120
Natsuki-chan, did you solve question three?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.410
The Student Council President is amazing,
she got number one!

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.370
Mutsumi-chan's also in the top 30.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.330
And Natsuki-chan is... what?

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.540
She must not have felt well that day.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.540
And she still took the test?

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.700
Those sisters are so outstanding!

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.830
What is up with that excessive praise?!

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:57.750
Stop it, it's embarrassing!

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:02.370
It's okay! Natsuki-chan, you're... um...

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.870
Seventeen chains!

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:06.370
Natsuki, you're so good!

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:09.120
You were number one in
the gaming tournament we did yesterday!

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:13.290
Sorry, Mutsumi. I'm not happy to be praised for that.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:17.080
How did you manage to get a good grade, too?!

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.870
You're busy with work, aren't you?

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.700
I had Big Sister Misa help me study.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:27.410
I hate studying. I don't see the point.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.120
By the way, how did Takuma-kun do?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.700
Takuma's ranking has always been...

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.000
Huh?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.500
What's going on?!
You're by far the worst in the entire grade!

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:42.450
That's how it always is.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:48.290
Whoa

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:48.290
I can't concentrate on the exam
when there are people around me.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.200
eep
rumble
twitch
omg
shake
shake
panic
rumble
fidget

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.830
I can't solve the problems that I always get right.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:54.450
It's your phobia of people, huh?

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.750
And the entrance exams are next year...

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:57.950
What do I do...

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:04.450
Grab

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.700
You can't just be depressed forever!

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:04.000
That will make your affliction even worse!

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:06.830
Natsuki-chan, calm down!

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:11.250
It's an akuma!

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:12.160
Help me!
It's an akuma!

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.080
Help me!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.700
Yamada fell out of the window again!

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:16.330
Call an ambulance!

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:18.290
That was awful!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.750
C'mon, we made a decision about that, right?

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.290
We're not going to talk about Takuma-kun's illness.

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:26.790
I know that! I know, but...

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.200
He's just...

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.580
working so hard, but still...

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:53.870
Takuma Akutsu-kun, please come to
the AV room immediately. Once again...

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:55.450
Audio Visual Room

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.910
E-excuse me.

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:03.950
I wonder who it is and what they want with me.

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:06.700
I did badly on the test,
and I caused a huge commotion...

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:08.370
Am I being expelled or something?

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.200
My stomach hurts.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:15.290
U-uh, is anyone here?

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:24.000
Chains?!

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:35.250
There's no difference between humans
and Valkyries who are not in their battle forms.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:41.700
However, I am able to summon
my "Sacred Sword" level one version.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.160
S-Student Council President...

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:45.750
What in the world is this...

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:49.000
Obviously for your date with me.

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:54.950
According to my father's oracle, we still have time
before the next demon is summoned.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.330
I have to level up now.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:02.370
B-but... killing monsters and stuff
is a lot of responsibility for me,

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:05.040
and I have studying to do...

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:07.700
I saw the test results.

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:11.120
Everyone has their own personal inclinations.

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.200
Things like studying are quite trivial...

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:16.620
You're someone who will become
the hero that saves the world.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:17.750
But...

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.450
Or, Takuma-san...

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:30.450
...is it that you hate me?

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:34.450
I-I-I-I don't hate you or anything...

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.580
Really?

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:38.040
Okay...

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.450
I don't care either way.

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:42.000
I'm so glad.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.410
I couldn't care less about Takuma-san.

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:49.660
Our father, Odin, is the head of the gods.

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:54.410
It is precisely due to that diginified position,
that he is the only man I will love.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:58.040
He will defend the human world...
defend Midgard, from the hands of the akuma.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:03.000
That power was given to me by my father,
and as the fifth Valkyrie, it is my mission.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.410
Therefore, I have only one goal.

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:10.540
I will date you, level up, and become
the strongest of the Valkyries!

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:13.040
Once I do that... Yes! I am certain...

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:21.580
Ta-da

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:19.330
My father will give me a pat on the head!

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:21.580
"Father Complex"

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:21.580
Itsuyo has a "father complex."

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.580
Student Council President?

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:33.250
Takuma-san, when it's just the two of us,
you must call me Itsuyo!

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:35.200
Oh no, this isn't good.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.540
I'm subconsciously getting excited... or not.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:40.580
It's just that I have so much respect for my father!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.250
Please relax.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:46.040
I am aware of the illness you are suffering from.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.540
Let's just move things one step forward.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.750
I am simply fulfilling my duties.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:58.000
By the way, Takuma-san,
have you already had your lunch?

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.330
N-no, not yet.

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:01.910
If that's the case...

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:06.700
I mistakenly packed enough lunch
for two people today.

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:09.540
If you don't mind, would you like to eat with me?

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.830
Uh, but...

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:13.250
Now, now, no need to be shy.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.500
Say "ah"!

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:20.450
Val love, "Have Lover Eat
Something Homemade," initiated.

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:17.450
Val Love

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.540
Have lover eat something homemade

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.500
Initiated

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:31.080
Failed

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:31.080
Failed.

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:39.120
hack
shake

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:35.120
Th-there's a wiener octopus in my eye!

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:38.950
I-I'm sorry! I was so nervous
it wouldn't go down my throat...

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:42.040
So we're doing this the hard way, are we?

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.040
Relax, Takuma-san.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:47.620
Everyone has had at least one instance
where they couldn't get something down.

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:51.290
Yeah!

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:49.540
We're going on to the next one!

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:50.660
Er...

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.910
Val Love, "5-minute massage"

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:52.370
Val Love

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:54.290
5-minute massage

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:59.580
Tense

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:57.200
He's stiff... his body's so stiff!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.450
Sorry, I'm nervous.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.870
Failed

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.870
Failed.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.000
Val Love

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.620
Val love, "Link Arms for One Minute"

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.620
Link Arms for One Minute

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:09.830
Strain

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:07.290
Your arms won't open!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.830
Sorry, I'm nervous.

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.120
Failed

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.120
Failed.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.830
Val love, "Gaze at Each Other for 30 Seconds."

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.290
Val Love

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:14.830
Gaze at Each Other for 30 Seconds

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:19.870
Tremble

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:17.120
Quit rolling your eyes into the back of your head!

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:19.790
Sorry, I'm nervous.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.080
Failed

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.080
Failed.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.620
gloom

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:25.830
H-he's difficult!

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:28.580
To think that Takuma-san is this incompetent...

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:29.660
What do I do?

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.580
You must think, Itsuyo Saotome...

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:33.540
no, Schwertleite!

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:35.950
You can surely come up with something brilliant...

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:40.290
Okay, I'm going back now!

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:44.290
all alone...

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:45.290
Girls' Changing Room

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:57.120
At this rate, I won't raise my level at all!

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:59.700
Student Council President! How do you-

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:00.950
Just lovely!

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.620
She told us she was lovely!

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:08.290
Does he not find pleasure simply in being bound up?

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:11.250
And Father was so pleased by that...

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:15.410
You say we still have time before the next battle,

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:17.750
so why are you in such a rush?

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:21.750
That's rich coming from someone who did what she
wanted with reckless abandon the other day.

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.200
I-I had to, that was an emergency situation.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.620
I'm sure you did.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:29.160
Even so, you've been rather active lately, Itsuyo.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.540
And you used to be such a cry baby.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:38.660
That's right. I'm different now.

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:45.120
There are still plenty of chances left!

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.330
I cannot lose heart after that!

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:52.200
An akuma?!

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:55.410
It can't be... It shouldn't have been summoned yet!

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:58.580
There's no way Father's oracle could be wrong again.

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:00.620
Moreover...

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:03.080
That akuma is...

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:04.950
What is that?

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.250
A balloon?

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:11.620
There was a message from Valhalla a little while ago.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.870
It said an increase of aether
has been observed on the Bifröst.

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:18.120
Then it's the real thing...

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.120
Yes.

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:22.160
An akuma is here.

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:26.450
Itsuyo! What's with that akuma?!

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:29.700
That akuma is strong beyond the limits of your blade.

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:32.910
Finally... my turn has come!

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:37.700
When I succeed here,
my father will surely pat me on the head!

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:41.370
I'll do a splendid job binding you in my chains.

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:43.660
Student Council President, hello!

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:45.580
A lovely day to you!

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:56.250
The barrier has been successfully deployed.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.700
We're safe for the moment.

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:02.000
Before looking into the reason why
Father's oracle was wrong,

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.540
we must defeat that akuma.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:08.660
It seems I'd have trouble dealing with
this one without my chain.

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:12.950
Unfortunately, with my level so low,
I don't stand a chance against it.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:15.580
This is definitely a lot to deal with for my sword.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:20.450
Alright. I'll lure the akuma away, so once you
raise your level make your way there.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:22.450
Um... What about me?

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:25.200
You're not suited for battle, so standby!

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.660
O-okay.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.040
Now hurry up and transform.

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:30.290
I-I'm going to!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:34.700
C-close your eyes!

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:35.540
Huh?

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.750
Just do it!

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.500
Seventh Valkyrie
"Siegrune"
Blade Lv. 22 ***

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:56.870
Wow

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:54.160
Okay, I'm heading out.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:56.870
Make your way there as soon as you raise your level.

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:00.620
I'm off!

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.410
I've won!

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:08.950
What was with that childish kiss of Natsuki's?

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:12.450
If that were me, I'd be able to showcase
a much more adult kiss!

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.330
Um, Itsuyo-chan.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:17.250
Is there anything I can do to help?

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.910
I want to help you two.

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:21.450
C'mon, Takuma-san! Let's go!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.620
Dash

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:24.330
Have you seen the President?

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.330
Secretary

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:29.040
There's a joint gym class with Class D,
but I haven't seen her for a while.

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:31.500
I'm sorry, I don't know where she is.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:33.500
Where in the world could she be?

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:42.580
Inside the barrier is a different dimension
separate from our reality.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:44.910
No matter how violent it gets, it's okay.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:55.330
Physical attacks aren't effective against Frosti.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:58.410
To defeat him, we must first bind him with chains.

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:02.080
I can create up to fifty swords at my current level.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:04.000
That's what I'll do until Itsuyo gets here.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:06.950
I'll just have to ride this out.

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:07.290
Gym Storage Room

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:12.330
Val Love, "Get Intimate in
the Gym Storage Room," initiated!

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:15.040
You can't escape me again!

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.910
Um... Er...

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:19.700
To satisfy this condition, we must make out.

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:23.040
We can't call it "getting intimate"
if only one of us is excited about it.

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:25.160
I can't be the only one taking the lead.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.910
I have to make Takuma-san feel like
he wants to as well!

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.830
Please relax, Takuma-san.

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.790
Frozen stiff

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:36.200
There's nothing here to be afraid of.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:39.830
We have no choice but to do this
in order to save the world.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.750
So...

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.500
will you hold me?

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:56.000
Shock

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.950
I kind of have a headache...

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:56.000
I want to escape from here as soon as possible!

00:15:56.620 --> 00:16:00.120
But it'd be awful if the world were destroyed.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:02.040
I have to do what the President says...

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.450
O-okay.

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.450
Score!

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:12.830
Takuma-san has finally been captivated by my charm!

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.700
And now, at last...

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:19.370
I can take the first step towards
becoming the strongest Valkyrie!

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.950
It's alright.

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:28.700
I don't have to worry about anything.

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:31.540
I'm a different person than who I was.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:34.250
All of this...

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:36.540
is so my father...

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:40.330
will pat me on the head.

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:56.290
She's so slow! What are they doing over there?!

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.540
If she doesn't get here soon...

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:15.790
That was careless...

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:22.950
I'm so sorry.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:26.950
There was a mosquito on your cheek.

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:30.000
Well, let's move on to the next...

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:34.000
to the next...

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:39.870
Th-this isn't... I am... well...

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:44.120
She's completely petrified.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.540
What should I do about this?

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:56.250
Dad, is it true?

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:59.700
Will a war start soon and will everyone die?

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:03.040
I don't want to be away from everyone.

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:05.620
Do not worry.

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:09.910
Schwertleite, I will protect you all no matter what.

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:15.080
So please become strong as well and support me.

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:18.000
If you do that, everyone will undoubtedly survive.

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.120
I'm counting on you.

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:23.580
Okay!

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:28.830
What's so different from how I was?

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.250
I haven't grown in any way at all.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:34.290
I'm the same as when I couldn't do
anything on my own...

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:42.870
Huh?

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:46.000
O-oh, uh, w-well... I'm sorry!

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:50.620
A long time ago when I would cry, my mom would
do this and it'd c-c-calm me down, and uh...

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:55.080
Er, s-s-sorry... if it b-bothers you, th-th-then I...

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.790
Such big hands...

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:02.370
This is just like... when my father
would pat me on the head.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:07.370
Val Love, "Get Intimate in the
Gym Storage Room," accomplished.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.080
Val Love

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:06.000
Get Intimate in the Gym Storage Room accomplished

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.370
Experience Points Entered

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:08.620
Schwertleite level up confirmed

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.870
Experience points entered,
Schwertleite level up confirmed.

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:16.500
I'd be able to showcase a much more adult kiss!

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.250
The protective barrier...

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:35.080
is being destroyed!

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:39.330
Itsuyo!

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.250
What's that?

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.410
Stand back!

00:19:57.660 --> 00:19:59.660
There's no use struggling.

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:02.620
Everything is sealed when you're bound with this.

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:05.750
Your body, your heart, and your abilities.

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:07.910
That's how my chains work.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.950
I'm leaving the rest to you, Natsuki!

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:11.250
Fifth Valkyrie
"Schwertleite"
Chain Lv. 14

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:13.330
I was so sick of waiting for you!

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:30.040
I do apologize for that.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.790
I can't believe you came looking for me!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:35.790
This is such a large campus I lost my way...

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:39.620
It's okay. The classes moved in practically no time,

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:42.660
and I had informed the teachers
ahead of time anyways.

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:46.330
I figured that guy must be the root of all this.

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:47.370
Now, now.

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:49.410
Er, I didn't do anything...

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:54.790
Matsumura-san, let's go.

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.370
Huh? O-okay.

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:57.580
I'm sorry.

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:59.080
It's okay. It's our job.

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:01.330
You two got pretty close, huh?

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:03.040
I-is that how it looks?

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:06.000
I hope you can keep this up
and cure your phobia of people

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:07.870
and improve your grades as well.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:08.790
Huh?

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.750
Let's go too.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.410
S-sorry!

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:18.540
Dammit.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:21.950
Is that seriously the Valkyries' lover "Einheijer"?!

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:25.160
Presenting himself in front of them in that pitiful state...

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:29.500
Here they say you have to take
what they give you and so on,

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:32.370
but in my case, before it's even set before me...

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:34.540
I'm going to devour it.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:36.040
Watchdog
"Garm"
Fang Lv. 65

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:09.160
You did see that, right, Natsuki?

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:11.620
I leveled up the power of my chains!

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:14.290
Fights with the akuma are going to get
even more intense,

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:16.500
so it'd be a problem if you didn't
at least do that much.

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:19.750
By the way, it took you way too long to get it done.

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:21.080
What in the world did you do?

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:23.500
Without telling you the specifics,

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:26.410
underneath it all Takuma-san is surprisingly wild...

00:23:26.410 --> 00:23:27.870
Wh-what?!

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:30.830
While I was desperately trying subdue the akuma,
the two of you were...

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:32.540
Shameful!

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:41.040
Next time: 
The Secret Maiden

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:35.410
Next time: "The Secret Maiden."

00:23:35.410 --> 00:23:37.700
I can't tell Natsuki that all I could do

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:39.700
was give him that kiss!
